    "title": "Chalkboard Fantasy Sports",
    "description": "PLAY CHALKBOARD FANTASY SPORTS\r\nWin up to 100x your money by simply choosing more or less on the projected stat lines of your favorite players! NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, College Sports, Soccer, and more sports coming soon.\r\n\r\n\r\n$100 DEPOSIT MATCH & FREE SQUARE FOR NEW USERS\r\nNew users get a 100% match on your initial deposit + a free square special to help you win big from the start!\r\n\r\n\r\nSHIELD PLAY PICK INSURANCE\r\nMissed 1 or 2 picks? Our Shield Play option provides insurance on your picks, offering a safety net if things don\u2019t go as planned.\r\n\r\n\r\n100X YOUR MONEY IN A SINGLE ENTRY\r\nPotential to multiply your stake by 100 times in a single entry, offering massive payout opportunities.\r\n\r\n\r\nQUICK & EASY WITHDRAWALS\r\nWhen you win, you can withdraw your cash fast & securely! In fact, over $100 million has been won by customers already!\r\n\r\n\r\nDAILY ALTERNATE LINES\r\nChoose your own performance lines daily, allowing for flexible and strategic entries!\r\n\r\n\r\nLIVE PICKS & TRACKING\r\nMissed kickoff? No problem. With Chalkboard\u2019s new Live Picks, you can jump in the action at anytime to place mid-game entries! Monitor your picks in real-time with our live-stat tracking.\r\n\r\n\r\nPLAY RESPONSIBLY\r\nFor Chalkboard Fantasy Sports, you must be at least 18 to enter. Higher age restrictions may apply. Not available in all jurisdictions. See https://helps.chalkboard.io/en/ for full game rules, terms, and conditions.\r\n\r\n\r\nResponsible Gambling:\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease play responsibly. For help, visit https://www.ncpgambling.org\r\nCall 1-800-426-2537 or access www.800gambler.org\r\nCall 1-800-522-4700 National Council on Problem Gambling or access www.ncpgambling.org",
